    {
      "kind": "lattice",
      "title": "Hamiltonian",
      "lines": [
        "$H=-t\\sum_{\\langle i,j\\rangle}(b_i^\\dagger b_j+b_j^\\dagger b_i)+\\frac{U}{2}\\sum_i n_i(n_i-1)-\\mu\\sum_i n_i$",
        "$t=1,\\quad U=16.74,\\quad\\mu=0$",
        "$N_{\\rm tot}=L_xL_y,\\quad 0\\leq n_i\\leq4$",
        "Open long axis; periodic short axis"
      ],
      "fontsize": 40,
      "y": 0.8,
      "step": 0.16,
      "footer": "The 2D interaction uses U/2; the earlier 1D slides used U multiplying n(n\u22121). Width-four cylinders are finite benchmarks."
    },
    {
      "kind": "equations",
      "title": "Fixed particle number",
      "lines": [
        "$\\Psi_{\\theta,N}(\\mathbf{n})\\propto\\delta_{\\sum_i n_i,N}\\,e^{f_\\theta(\\mathbf{n})}$",
        "$P_{\\theta,N}(\\mathbf{n})=|\\Psi_{\\theta,N}(\\mathbf{n})|^2$",
        "Particle-conserving sampling stays in the selected sector.",
        "The neural output itself is unconstrained outside that sector."
      ],
      "fontsize": 43,
      "step": 0.14,
      "footer": "All overlaps and VMC expectations use canonical-sector normalization; no full-Fock-space leakage curve is claimed."
    },
