        "$\\mathcal{L}_{\\log}=\\frac{1}{D_N}\\sum_{\\mathbf{n}\\in\\mathcal{H}_N}[\\widetilde{f}_\\theta(\\mathbf{n})-\\log\\Psi_{\\rm ED}(\\mathbf{n})]^2$",
        "$F_{\\rm abs}=|\\langle\\Psi_\\theta|\\Psi_{\\rm ED}\\rangle|,\\qquad\\mathcal{L}_{\\rm infidelity}=1-F_{\\rm abs}^2$",
        "Log-MSE is primary; infidelity refinement is a separate diagnostic."
      ],
      "fontsize": 42,
